<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 88, background: '#0E3F8C', width: '100%', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 40, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>母体函数：aggregate(products)</Text>
    <Text style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 16, opacity: 0.8 }}>JS 前端 · 项目三</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', flex: 1, padding: 32, gap: 28 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 640, background: '#0F172A', borderRadius: 8, padding: 18 }}>
      <CodeBlock
        code={`function aggregate(list) {
  const r = { total: list.length, stockSum: 0,
    priceSum: 0, cats: {}, maxPrice: -Infinity,
    minPrice: Infinity };
  for (const p of list) {
    r.stockSum += p.stock;
    r.priceSum += p.price;
    r.cats[p.category] =
      (r.cats[p.category] || 0) + 1;
    if (p.price > r.maxPrice)
      r.maxPrice = p.price;
    if (p.price < r.minPrice)
      r.minPrice = p.price;
  }
  r.catCount = Object.keys(r.cats).length;
  r.avgPrice = Math.round(
    r.priceSum / r.total * 100) / 100;
  return r;
}`}
        language='javascript'
        width={604}
        fontSize={13}
      />
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>返回统计对象</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
        total / stockSum / priceSum / cats<br />
        catCount / maxPrice / minPrice / avgPrice
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>母体一致性</span>：函数名、参数、返回结构与期末综合案例（项目七 renderProducts 数据驱动渲染汇合处）<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>逐字一致</span>。静态起步模板目前还没有它，由你在项目三从零创建，期末直接复用，零跳变。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>JS 前端 · 项目三 · 循环与商品批量统计</Text>
